            <h2>Trade Anywhere, <span class="gold">Anytime</span></h2>
            <p>Join a global community of traders from over 150 countries. Access the same powerful trading tools whether you're on desktop, tablet, or mobile.</p>
            <div class="stats-row">
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="num">150+</span>
                    <span class="label">Countries</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="num">24/7</span>
                    <span class="label">Market Access</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="num">50M+</span>
                    <span class="label">Trades Executed</span>
                </div>
            </div>
