            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         SECTION 6: FEATURES GRID
         ============================================================ -->
    <section class="features" id="features">
        <h2 class="section-title">Built for the <span class="gold">Next Generation</span></h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Everything you need to trade crypto with confidence and precision</p>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">📊</span><h3>Advanced Charts</h3><p>Professional-grade charting with 50+ indicators, multiple timeframes, and drawing tools.</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">🔒</span><h3>Bank-Grade Security</h3><p>Military-grade encryption, cold storage, and multi-factor authentication to protect your assets.</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">⚡</span><h3>Lightning Fast Execution</h3><p>Execute trades in milliseconds with our high-performance matching engine handling 100,000 TPS.</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">💰</span><h3>Lowest Fees</h3><p>Competitive fee structure starting from 0.1% with volume-based discounts for active traders.</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">📱</span><h3>Trade Anywhere</h3><p>Full-featured mobile app available on iOS and Android. Trade on the go, anytime.</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><span class="feature-icon">💎</span><h3>Premium 24/7 Support</h3><p>Dedicated customer support with account managers for institutional clients.</p></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         SECTION 7: VIDEO HERO 2 - Advanced Tools
         ============================================================ -->
