         ============================================================ -->
    <section class="ai-section">
        <div class="ai-grid">
            <div class="ai-content">
                <span class="tag" style="display:inline-block; padding:4px 14px; background:rgba(240,185,11,0.1); border-radius:20px; color:#f0b90b; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:12px;">🤖 AI Powered</span>
                <h2>24/7 AI <span class="gold">Trading Assistant</span></h2>
                <p>Our advanced AI bot is available 24/7 to assist you with market analysis, trade execution, and portfolio management. Get instant insights and make smarter trading decisions.</p>
                <ul class="features-list">
                    <li>Real-time market analysis and predictions</li>
                    <li>Automated trade execution based on your strategy</li>
                    <li>Portfolio optimization and risk management</li>
                    <li>Personalized trading recommendations</li>
                </ul>
