                <p style="margin-top:8px; font-size:13px;">Active since 2024 • 50k+ trades executed</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         SECTION 10: ABOUT US / GLOBAL
         ============================================================ -->
    <section class="about-section">
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-content">
                <span class="tag" style="display:inline-block; padding:4px 14px; background:rgba(240,185,11,0.1); border-radius:20px; color:#f0b90b; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:12px;">🌍 Global Reach</span>
                <h2>Operating <span class="gold">Worldwide</span></h2>
                <p>TradeFlow is a global trading platform serving users in over 150 countries. We are committed to providing a secure, transparent, and accessible trading experience for everyone, everywhere.</p>
